<title>USA: Coca-Cola Enterprises sets $300 mln in bonds.</title>
<headline>Coca-Cola Enterprises sets $300 mln in bonds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following debt issue was priced on Thursday, according to lead manager Salomon Brothers</p>
<p>BORROWER COCA-COLA ENTERPRISES</p>
<p>AMT $300 MLN	 COUPON 6.70 PCT   MATURITY 10/15/2036</p>
<p>TYPE BONDS	   ISS PRICE 99.904  PAY DATE N.A.</p>
<p>LAST MOODY A3	SPREAD +22 BP     PAY FREQ N.A.</p>
<p>LAST S&amp;P AA-MINUS  YIELD 6.717 PCT   PUTABLE ON 10/15/2003</p>
<p>-- Corporate bond unit 212-859-1678</p>
